# Free API key from https://rawg.io/apidocs — used to fetch accurate
# cover art. Without it, cover lookup falls back to Wikipedia (less
# precise). Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key for
# local development; for the deployed GitHub Pages build, set it as
# the RAWG_API_KEY repository secret instead (Settings > Secrets and
# variables > Actions).
VITE_RAWG_API_KEY=
